w additional features I’d like to see. First, a MacOS version of the app would be great, though I can confirm that it does work to install the iOS version. However, it would really be awesome if it could sync to iCloud both to make this actually usable, as well as to make it easy when you get a new device. There is an export / import feature for this but this would make it a lot. Lee seamless. Finally, it would be nice to have additional Shortcuts support - the ability to look at past completions / streaks, change completion for other dates, export / import from Shortcut, etc.With that list, why did I still give it 5 stars? Because even as-is it is incredibly useful and I would recommend it to everyone even without these features (though they would be great!)<!-- HTML_TAG_END --> <div class="developer-response-container svelte-1jsby4n"><div class="developer-response-header svelte-1jsby4n"><span class="developer-response-heading svelte-1jsby4n">Developer Response</span> <time class="date svelte-1jsby4n" datetime="2025-01-20T14:06:50.000Z">Jan 20</time></div> <!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Hey! Thanks for the awesome review and your feedback. Mac support and cross-device sync are on the roadmap!I really appreciate that you still rated it 5 stars even though it doesn't have every feature you wish for!<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></div></p></article> </div> </div> </dialog> </div></li>   <li class="shelf-grid__list-item svelte-12rmzef" data-index="1" aria-hidden="true"><div class="svelte-12rmzef"><article aria-labelledby="review-11526306665-title" class="svelte-1jsby4n"><div class="header svelte-1jsby4n"><div class="title-and-rating-container svelte-1jsby4n"><h3 id="review-11526306665-title" class="title svelte-1jsby4n"> <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1a7gcr6" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1a7gcr6">Great Simple App, Great Developer, Some Limitations</span> </div></h3> <div style="display: contents; --f