e-1jsby4n"><time class="date svelte-1jsby4n" datetime="2024-04-24T19:09:15.000Z">04/24/2024</time>  <div class="multiline-clamp svelte-1a7gcr6" style="--mc-lineClamp: var(--defaultClampOverride, 1);" role="text"> <span class="multiline-clamp__text svelte-1a7gcr6"><p class="author svelte-1jsby4n">AngletonReviews</p></span> </div></div></div> <div class="content svelte-1jsby4n">  <div class="truncate-wrapper svelte-1ji3yu5"><p data-testid="truncate-text" dir="auto" class="content svelte-1ji3yu5" style="--lines: 3; --line-height: var(--lineHeight, 16); --link-length: 4;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->The app is an intuitive, visually pleasing way to track your habits. It does a great job of allowing users to customize their habits while not crowding the ui or creating a convoluted user experience. Overall, it is a near-perfect habit tracker with a nice minimalist aestheticAlso, the developer shows a lot of respect for the users of the app. I wrote to them regarding some functionality that I was hoping they would add and they quickly wrote back to let me know they were working on that. A couple months later they reached out to let me know they were rolling out that feature! In my experience, it is hard to find a developer that is so genuinely responsive to user feedbackLastly, the app, which does have a premium option, makes the non-premium version actually worthwhile to use and offers the premium version via both subscription and one-time-purchase. Both of those are big pluses in my book!<!-- HTML_TAG_END --></p> </div>  <div class="developer-response-container svelte-1jsby4n"><span class="developer-response-heading svelte-1jsby4n">Developer Response</span>   <div class="truncate-wrapper svelte-1ji3yu5"><p data-testid="truncate-text" dir="auto" class="content svelte-1ji3yu5" style="--lines: 1; --line-height: var(--lineHeight, 16); --link-length: 4;"><!-- HTML_TAG_START -->Thank you so much for the awesome review, I really appreciate your support and am happy that you like my 