• Smart Icon/Emoji Search: Find the perfect emoji or icon quickly with our intuitive search feature - type what you feel, find what you need.</p> <div class="metadata svelte-13339ih"><h4 class="svelte-13339ih">1.12.0</h4> <time datetime="2025-04-29" class="svelte-13339ih">Apr 29</time></div></div> </article> </li><li><article class="svelte-13339ih detail"><div class="container svelte-13339ih"><p class="svelte-13339ih">This version includes the following changes:
