• Added a link in the settings menu to my other app, Liftbear.
• Bugfixes and performance optimizations.</p> <div class="metadata svelte-13339ih"><h4 class="svelte-13339ih">1.11.1</h4> <time datetime="2025-04-16" class="svelte-13339ih">Apr 16</time></div></div> </article> </li><li><article class="svelte-13339ih detail"><div class="container svelte-13339ih"><p class="svelte-13339ih">Track Without Limits: Your habits are now more flexible than ever with unlimited tracking capabilities.
