• Enhanced Input Experience: A sleek new dialog makes tracking your progress more intuitive than ever.</p> <div class="metadata svelte-13339ih"><h4 class="svelte-13339ih">1.11.0</h4> <time datetime="2025-04-02" class="svelte-13339ih">Apr 2</time></div></div> </article> </li><li><article class="svelte-13339ih detail"><div class="container svelte-13339ih"><p class="svelte-13339ih">This release includes bug fixes and important performance optimizations.</p> <div class="metadata svelte-13339ih"><h4 class="svelte-13339ih">1.10.3</h4> <time datetime="2025-02-18" class="svelte-13339ih">Feb 18</time></div></div> </article> </li><li><article class="svelte-13339ih detail"><div class="container svelte-13339ih"><p class="svelte-13339ih">This release includes the following changes:
• Remove the "Year In Review" feature from the dashboard
• Changing the category icon doesn't apply to the overview
• Make categories reorderable
• Fix the missing translation for "Create your own"
• Make categories deletable (from the overview)</p> <div class="metadata svelte-13339ih"><h4 class="svelte-13339ih">1.10.2</h4> <time datetime="2025-01-08" class="svelte-13339ih">Jan 8</time></div></div> </article> </li><li><article class="svelte-13339ih detail"><div class="container svelte-13339ih"><p class="svelte-13339ih">This release brings back the "Year In Review" page for everyone.</p> <div class="metadata svelte-13339ih"><h4 class="svelte-13339ih">1.10.1</h4> <time datetime="2024-12-27" class="svelte-13339ih">12/27/2024</time></div></div> </article> </li><li><article class="svelte-13339ih detail"><div class="container svelte-13339ih"><p class="svelte-13339ih">Dashboard Customization: We've added a lot of new customization options to your dashboard.
