of the app.","style":"overview","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"Version 1.14.2","secondarySubtitle":"Thu Oct 02 2025 08:11:11 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"}],"url":null,"mergeWhenFetched":false,"fetchStrategy":"onPageLoad","batchGroup":null,"seeAllAction":{"impressionMetrics":null,"title":"Version History","artwork":null,"presentationStyle":[],"actionClass":"FlowAction","$kind":"flowAction","actionMetrics":{"data":[{"fields":{"location":[{"locationPosition":2,"locationType":"button","name":"Version History"}],"actionType":"navigate","target":"button_See All","eventType":"click","targetType":"button","targetId":"See All","platformContext":"iphone","alt_ab2_data":"[]"},"includingFields":["impressionsSnapshot","pageFields","contentRestrictionReasons"],"excludingFields":["amsMetricsID"],"topic":"xp_amp_appstore_unidentified","shouldFlush":false}],"custom":{}},"page":"versionHistory","pageData":{"shelves":[{"impressionMetrics":null,"contentType":"titledParagraph","marker":null,"items":[{"text":"Important bugfixes for the reminder system of the app.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.14.2","secondarySubtitle":"Thu Oct 02 2025 08:11:11 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"• New Icons Added: Meditation, crafts, sports, fashion, music & tech icons\n• Bug fixes and performance improvements","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.14.1","secondarySubtitle":"Mon Sep 01 2025 09:49:58 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"Enhanced Reminder System - Set up to 3 reminders per habit with our completely redesigned notification system\nDaily Check-In Reminders - Get daily notifications to review and complete your habits\nPerformance Improvements - Smoother experience with enhanced reliability","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.14.0","secondarySubtitle":"Mon Aug 18 2025 07:52:01 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"Important bug fixes and performance optimizations.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.13.4","secondarySubtitle":"Tue Aug 05 2025 09:59:36 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"Bug fixes and small improvements.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.13.3","secondarySubtitle":"Wed Jul 09 2025 13:18:54 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"Bug fixes and small improvements.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.13.2","secondarySubtitle":"Thu Jun 26 2025 08:11:41 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"Bug fixes and small improvements.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.13.1","secondarySubtitle":"Wed Jun 18 2025 07:37:22 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"New Habit Detail View & Improvements:\n• Fresh Habit Details - Redesigned habit detail view with integrated calendar for better progress tracking\n• Compact List Enhancements - Customize day count display and toggle habit names for a cleaner interface\n• Performance Boost - Fixed numerous bugs and improved app performance for a smoother experience","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.13.0","secondarySubtitle":"Mon Jun 16 2025 08:00:31 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"This release includes important bug fixes and performance optimizations.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.12.1","secondarySubtitle":"Mon May 05 2025 08:29:10 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"Emoji Support: Make your habits more personal and meaningful with our new emoji support.\n• Personalized Expression: Choose from a wide variety of emojis to represent your habits in a way that resonates with you.\n• Smart Icon/Emoji Search: Find the perfect emoji or icon quickly with our intuitive search feature - type what you feel, find what you need.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.12.0","secondarySubtitle":"Tue Apr 29 2025 08:19:26 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"This version includes the following changes:\n• Configure the start of the week, whether it's Sunday, Monday or Wednesday. HabitKit is as flexible as possible.\n• Added a \"Manage Subscription\" button to the subscribers view.\n• Added a link in the settings menu to my other app, Liftbear.\n• Bugfixes and performance optimizations.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.11.1","secondarySubtitle":"Wed Apr 16 2025 08:32:07 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"Track Without Limits: Your habits are now more flexible than ever with unlimited tracking capabilities.\n• Personalized Tracking: Track your progress your way - whether it's pages read, minutes meditated, or any other metric that matters to you.\n• Go Beyond Goals: Push past your daily targets and celebrate every achievement, no matter how big.\n• Enhanced Input Experience: A sleek new dialog makes tracking your progress more intuitive than ever.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.11.0","secondarySubtitle":"Wed Apr 02 2025 07:07:29 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"This release includes bug fixes and important performance optimizations.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.10.3","secondarySubtitle":"Tue Feb 18 2025 07:02:01 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"This release includes the following changes:\n• Remove the \"Year In Review\" feature from the dashboard\n• Changing the category icon doesn't apply to the overview\n• Make categories reorderable\n• Fix the missing translation for \"Create your own\"\n• Make categories deletable (from the overview)","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.10.2","secondarySubtitle":"Wed Jan 08 2025 09:42:45 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"This release brings back the \"Year In Review\" page for everyone.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.10.1","secondarySubtitle":"Fri Dec 27 2024 13:14:17 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"Dashboard Customization: We've added a lot of new customization options to your dashboard.\n• FEATURE: Display Streaks: You can now display the streak and goals on your habits cards.\n• FEATURE: Display Labels: You can now display the month and weekday labels on your habits cards.\n• FEATURE: Display Categories: You can now display the category icons on your habits cards.\n• FIX: The category filter only allows one selected entry now.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.10.0","secondarySubtitle":"Tue Nov 26 2024 09:21:47 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"This update includes important bug fixes and performance improvements.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.9.5","secondarySubtitle":"Fri Nov 01 2024 12:58:46 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"This update adds support for iOS-18 tinted app icons and introduces new habit icons.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.9.4","secondarySubtitle":"Tue Oct 29 2024 10:06:32 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"This update includes important bugfixes and performance optimizations.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.9.3","secondarySubtitle":"Tue Oct 22 2024 08:28:53 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"This update includes important bugfixes and performance optimizations.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.9.2","secondarySubtitle":"Tue Oct 01 2024 08:19:08 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"This update fixes an issue about the app being stuck on the splash screen.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.9.1","secondarySubtitle":"Tue Sep 17 2024 04:38:59 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"Introducing Categories: Elevate your habit organization with our new category feature. Group related habits together and customize your dashboard for a more focused experience.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.9.0","secondarySubtitle":"Mon Sep 16 2024 06:05:32 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"This release fixes a bug which caused the Month view to ignore the \"Week starts on Sunday\" option.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.8.4","secondarySubtitle":"Fri Aug 16 2024 07:57:42 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"This release includes important bugfixes and performance improvements.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.8.3","secondarySubtitle":"Fri Aug 09 2024 08:34:26 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"},{"text":"This release includes important bugfixes and performance improvements.","style":"detail","wantsCollapsedNewlines":true,"primarySubtitle":"1.8.2","secondarySubtitle":"Tue Jul 30 2024 06:29:08 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time)"}],"url":null,"mergeWhenFetched":false,"fetchStrategy":"onPageLoad","batchGroup":null,"seeAllAction":null,"footerTitle":null,"footerAction":null,"eyebrow":null,"eyebrowArtwork":null,"footerStyle":null,"title":null,"titleArtwork":null,"subtitle":null,"isHorizontal":false,"isHidden":false,"rowsPerColumn":null,"background":{"type":"none"},"contentsMetadata":{"type":"none"},"isPersonalized":false,"shouldFilterApps":false}],"title":"Version History","presentationOptions":["prefersLargeTitle"],"isIncomplete":false,"pageMetrics":{"instructions":[{"data":{"fields":{"eventType":"impressions","impressionQueue":"data-metrics","eventVersion":4,"platformContext":"iphone","alt_ab2_data":"[]"},"includingFields":["impressions","pageFields","pageReferrer","contentRestrictionReasons","impressionsAppendix"],"excludingFields":["eventVersion","amsMetricsID"],"topic":"xp_amp_appstore_unidentified","shouldFlush":fals