5,"type":"rgb"},"style":"roundedRectPrerendered","crop":"bb","contentMode":null,"imageScale":null,"template":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/0d/8a/b6/0d8ab69f-0991-66be-5ea4-9ed9fc6aca8d/Placeholder.mill/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}","width":1024,"height":1024,"variants":[{"format":"jpeg","quality":70,"supportsWideGamut":false}]},"title":"HelloHabit - Habit Tracker","isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible":false,"useAdsLocale":false,"subtitle":"Daily Routine & Goal Planner","tertiaryTitle":null,"tertiaryTitleAction":null,"tertiaryTitleArtwork":null,"developerTagline":"Daily Routine & Goal Planner","editorialTagline":null,"editorialDescription":null,"shortEditorialDescription":null,"ageRating":"9+","productDescription":"Simple habit tracking, made easy. HelloHabit helps you set goals, build habits, and achieve success. Read the full feature set below:\n\nHABIT TRACKING\nCustom Habits: Personalize your routine with habits like exercise, run, steps, read, meditate, drink water, wake up early, sleep early, journal, brush teeth, cook, quit smoking, quit drinking, quit social media, quit skin picking, and more.\nSuggestions: Explore hundreds of habit ideas for your list, including fitness, health, productivity, and wellness goals.\nGoals: Set daily, weekly, monthly, or yearly targets to achieve your desired outcomes.\nReminders: Set up multiple reminders per habit to stay on track and build consistency.\nActivity Entries: Log unlimited activities for past or current dates to monitor your progress.\nStreaks and Stats: Track your progress with detailed streaks, statistics, and records to stay motivated.\nTimers: Stay focused with stopwatch or countdown timers for time-bound habits.\nHealth Sync: Automatically sync health-related habits with Apple Health for comprehensive tracking.\nQuit Trackers: Monitor the duration since quitting habits to celebrate milestones.\n\nJOURNAL\nDetailed Notes: Record insights and progress for each habit to reflect on your journey.\nRich Text Editor: Customize notes with formatting and styles for better organization.\nCentralized View: Access habit activity and notes in one place for easy reference.\nFiltering: Organize journal entries by habit to review specific areas of focus.\nBookmarking: Mark important notes for quick reference and easy access.\n\nSCHEDULE\nReminder Options: Set one-time, daily, weekly, or monthly reminders to keep your habits top of mind.\nUnlimited Reminders: Add as many reminders as needed for each habit to stay consistent.\nCalendar View: Check your schedule in daily, weekly, or monthly formats to plan ahead effectively.\n\nPLATFORM\nDark Mode: Try out a sleek, dark interface for comfortable nighttime use.\nCustomization: Personalize various settings to suit your preferences and needs.\nSync Across Devices: Access your data seamlessly on all your devices for convenience.\nCustomer Support: Get help via an in-app chat feature for quick assistance.\n\nHelloHabit offers all features for free within the following limits:\n- 5 total active habits\n- 1 reminder per habit\n- 3 journal notes per day\n\nHelloHabit Premium offers unlimited access. Start a free trial for an ongoing subscription or make a one-time payment for lifetime access. Country-specific pricing is visible within the app!\n\nTerms of Use: https://hellohabit.com/terms\nPrivacy Policy: https://hellohabit.com/privacy","rating":4.9,"ratingCount":"2K","buttonAction":{"impressionMetrics":null,"title":"Get","artwork":null,"presentationStyle":[],"actionClass":"OfferAction","$kind":"OfferAction","actionMetrics":{"data":[{"fields":{"reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","actionDetails":{"buyParams":"productType=C&price=0&salableAdamId=6476824223&pricingParameters=STDQ&pg=default&appExtVrsId=879759752"},"location":[{"locationPosition":0,"locationType":"button","name":"Get","reco_algoId":"cab_1","reco_eligible":"1","reco_hash":"cab_1","idType":"its_id","id":"6476824223"},{"locationPosition":5,"locationType